@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Data Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10 bg-white p-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm border border-light">
            <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4 text-success"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt me-3"></i>EthioChain Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted mb-5 border-bottom pb-4">Effective Date: April 2026</p>

            <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="fas fa-server text-primary me-2"></i> 1. Data Localization</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-4">EthioChain SCM is committed to Ethiopian data sovereignty. All critical supply chain telemetry, business licensing documents, and transaction records are encrypted and hosted on secure servers residing within Ethiopia, complying fully with the Ethiopian Data Protection Proclamation.</p>

            <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="fas fa-fingerprint text-primary me-2"></i> 2. Fayda Registry Data</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-4">When you verify your identity via the Fayda system, EthioChain securely receives only essential verification attributes (Full Name, Date of Birth). This data is never sold to third parties and is exclusively used to maintain a highly trusted B2B logistics ecosystem.</p>

            <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt text-primary me-2"></i> 3. Logistics & Telemetry Tracking</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-4">To provide real-time updates to retailers and vendors, delivery fleets connected to the platform may transmit geolocational data. This data is strictly used for estimating delivery times across regional routes and calculating optimized procurement paths.</p>

            <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="fas fa-user-lock text-primary me-2"></i> 4. Your Rights</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-4">You reserve the right to request a complete export of your enterprise's transaction ledger, inventory history, and data profile. Requests for account deletion will be processed within the legally mandated timeframe, preserving only data strictly required for financial auditing under the Ethiopian Revenue and Customs Authority (ERCA).</p>

            <hr class="my-5" />
            <p class="small text-muted text-center">© 2026 EthioChain SCM. Your digital supply chain, secured.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>